		"title": "Variation \"two columns\": minimal, + / − on the left, first closed, 7 questions",
		"markup": "<!-- wp:werun-community/accordion {\"accordionStyle\":\"minimal\",\"columns\":2,\"iconType\":\"plus\",\"iconPosition\":\"left\",\"showItemIcons\":false,\"allowMultiple\":false,\"firstOpen\":false,\"showSearch\":false,\"showExpandAll\":false,\"faqSchema\":false,\"title\":\"Two columns\"} -->\n<!-- wp:werun-community/accordion-item {\"question\":\"How long does a project take?\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most sites go live in four to eight weeks. See <a href=\"#pricing\">the pricing page</a> for the details.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:werun-community/accordion-item -->\n<!-- wp:werun-community/accordion-item {\"question\":\"Can I edit the site myself?\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes. Every page is built with blocks you can change, and we show your team how.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:werun-community/accordion-item -->\n<!-- wp:werun-community/accordion-item {\"question\":\"What happens after launch, and who looks after the updates, the backups and the security fixes once the site is live?\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Updates, backups and fixes for a month are included. After that, a monthly plan if you want one.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:werun-community/accordion-item -->\n<!-- wp:werun-community/accordion-item {\"question\":\"Do you work in other languages?\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes. Sites can be built in as many languages as you need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:werun-community/accordion-item -->\n<!-- wp:werun-community/accordion-item {\"question\":\"Do you host the site?\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We can, or we deploy to your own hosting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:werun-community/accordion-item -->\n<!-- wp:werun-community/accordion-item {\"question\":\"Is there a contract?\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A short one: scope, dates and price.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:werun-community/accordion-item -->\n<!-- wp:werun-community/accordion-item {\"question\":\"Can you migrate my old content?\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes: posts, pages and media.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:werun-community/accordion-item -->\n<!-- /wp:werun-community/accordion -->",
